# Mac setup

- To install or remove a tool or an app, or to change a setting, edit
  `~/.config/bootstrap/macos.toml`, then run `mise run updateall:configs`.
  `mise run updateall` also installs the packages.
- Never run `brew install`, `mise use -g` or `defaults write` directly.
- Development tools come from mise. Other tools and apps come from Homebrew.
- A file with the `Synced from bootstrap` header comes from bootstrap. Change
  it in bootstrap, not here. The next sync writes it again.
